(The FIB-4 score is a non-invasive index used to estimate the degree of liver fibrosis in patients with risk factors for chronic) Tj
ET
BT
22.03 481.32 TD
(liver disease, including chronic viral hepatitis, alcoholic liver disease, MASLD, and metabolic or cholestatic liver disorders. It) Tj
ET
BT
22.03 471.20 TD
(may also be used to monitor fibrosis progression over time in patients with established liver disease.) Tj
ET
/F4 10 Tf
