BT
22.03 453.51 TD
(A low FIB-4 score suggests a low likelihood of advanced fibrosis and may support conservative or medical management) Tj
ET
BT
22.03 443.39 TD
(without the need for liver biopsy, particularly if values remain stable on serial testing. In contrast, a high FIB-4 score is) Tj
ET
BT
22.03 433.27 TD
(suggestive of advanced fibrosis or cirrhosis and may warrant further evaluation, including consideration of liver biopsy,) Tj
ET
BT
22.03 423.15 TD
(unless corroborated by clinical findings or imaging indicative of advanced liver disease.) Tj
